<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni sees downward crown pressure H2 '97.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni sees downward crown pressure H2 '97.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech commercial bank Komercni Banka a.s. said on Friday it expected to see growing depreciation pressure against the Czech crown in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;In the second and third quarter of 1997 pressures towards depreciation of the exchange rate, both from the current account of the payment balance and from the decreasing interest (rate) differential of the Czech crown, will increase,&quot;</p>
</text>
